      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "Abstract art used to be controversial. On one hand, the artists stopped painting delicate figures but attempted to adopt special techniques to give people different visual impacts. On the other hand, their works, including sculptures carved out of marble or fragile clay, were all with a specific aim of showing feelings.",
        "zh": "抽象艺术曾经颇有争议。一方面，艺术家不再描绘精细的人物形象，而是尝试采用特殊技法，给人带来不同的视觉冲击。另一方面，他们的作品，包括用大理石或易碎黏土雕成的雕塑，都有一个明确目的：表达情感。",
        "start": 3.16,
        "voiceEnd": 28.906666666666666,
        "end": 54.653333333333336,
