      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "Some conventional scholars who were allergic to abstract art said it was evidently ridiculous and neither art nor geometry. Their Traditional Art Committee predicted that it would soon disappear. But nowadays, abstract art has become part of the permanent possessions of contemporary civilization.",
        "zh": "一些反感抽象艺术的传统学者，说这种艺术显然荒谬可笑，既算不上艺术，也算不上几何学。他们的传统艺术委员会预言，它很快就会消失。然而如今，抽象艺术已经成为当代文明永久财富的一部分。",
        "start": 54.653333333333336,
        "voiceEnd": 78.45,
        "end": 102.24666666666667,
        "voiceSeconds": 23.796666666666667,
